{"name": "Rise of the Cones: Planetary Defense", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/a02bf493bee074a8c9b80dc9d4cb9d80.poster.avif?t=1776963655\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/a02bf493bee074a8c9b80dc9d4cb9d80.webm?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/a02bf493bee074a8c9b80dc9d4cb9d80.mp4?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/7c30b0a7b6b750d28afe02c61a027e26.webp?t=1776963655\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something's coming down the path. Cone-shaped machines. Relentless, endless, and heading straight for your base. Your job: build the defense that stops them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic tower defense, with depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies follow paths. You place towers freely. Every tower type serves a different purpose; raw damage, crowd control, support, area denial. Knowing when to use what is half the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/5ddf4b30e995de6075b8b42d669f9807.poster.avif?t=1776963655\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/5ddf4b30e995de6075b8b42d669f9807.webm?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/5ddf4b30e995de6075b8b42d669f9807.mp4?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/f3436559e8ab18bbdaea77298575b9d6.webp?t=1776963655\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every tower has <strong>3 upgrade paths</strong>, each with\u00a0<strong>5 tiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you can only invest in\u00a0<strong>2 paths per tower</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That means every tower becomes a decision: do you go all-in on damage, build a long-range zone controller, or make something weird and flexible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/7e49bb411e9a5ce1d223ccb90ca2af8c.poster.avif?t=1776963655\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/7e49bb411e9a5ce1d223ccb90ca2af8c.webm?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/7e49bb411e9a5ce1d223ccb90ca2af8c.mp4?t=1776963655\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/extras/b21ef4593ea8dee8ca5140505da25459.webp?t=1776963655\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn research points from missions, unlock new towers and upgrades. The further you get, the wilder your builds become.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rise of the Cones is a tower defense game where a relentless army of cones is marching toward your base. They will not stop. Build towers, shape them with branching upgrades, and figure out how to hold the line.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262360/c3d4b3fcf60c8ba46c227cb352f44fb4b8390e08/header.jpg?t=1776963655", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Tower Defense", "Base Building", "Sci-fi", "RTS", "Realistic"], "developers": "Baris Lab", "publishers": "Baris Lab", "release_date": "Apr 23, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "4262360", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "18 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zweieJg8mhA", "first_seen": 1776463200.0, "review_rank": 822}